<title>PORTUGAL: Outlook positive for Portugal construction - INE.</title>
<headline>Outlook positive for Portugal construction - INE.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The outlook for the Portuguese construction sector is positive in the fourth quarter of the year, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said in its latest report of business opinion.</p>
<p>&quot;The prospects for higher prices, which first appeared in the second quarter, have been maintained,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>The main limiting factors were lack of demand, interest rates and a shortage of qualified labour, it said.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
